🔩 Hardware Components

        Component                     	Function

📡 Ultrasonic Sensor	         Measures gate-to-wall distance
🖥️ OLED Display	              Displays gate state and expressions
🔴 Red LED	                     Indicates OPEN state
🟢 Green LED	                 Indicates CLOSED state
🔊 Buzzer	                     Provides OPEN-state audible feedback
🔘 Control Switch                Enables/disables buzzer
⚙️ Microcontroller (ESP 32)	     Processes sensor data and controls outputs
🔌 Connecting Hardware	         Electrical connections between modules